istmas. This is the only soft side cooler I have ever used that does not leak and it is fabulous to take on a trip where you don't have much room for extra gear!"</p></span></div><div data-rid="5d2cc444-5ae3-422d-92dc-dd72ccc73086" class="r-1stqw3y alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>— Denise F.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="1c7be7f7-5bbe-4d39-9d1f-91860ff08ca2" class="r-idfvx1"><div data-rid="99c0116d-1d6d-4364-b54e-74ec9920d0cc" class="r-g4rxi8"><div data-rid="999c8393-c035-4c4d-a84f-b34c80a73705" class="r-pnjssy"><div data-rid="4eb1809f-1740-42e1-acfb-e0938093c6eb" class="r-1l7dbnd alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>STEP ONE</p></span></div><div data-rid="cc4e574b-0adc-4ba6-b6b8-3563f00a749e" class="r-3h2c1q alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>01</p></span></div><div data-rid="3669fb89-85ed-46e1-9137-c8f19084a259" class="r-e0p01n alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>Packs into Itself</h3></span></div><div data-rid="3114c48c-5591-409a-b532-2a72373da65c" class="r-1gaswz3 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Original Puffy Cooler™ folds into its built-in stuff-sack in seconds and is smaller than a hoodie. Toss it in your carry-on, purse, or daypack so it's always ready when plans turn into adventures.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="b699e104-02f1-4ec1-adab-dbfe4b5eacab" class="r-19ibl29"><picture data-rid="12dfd380-71b0-4009-9e9a-055a59ae864c" class="r-nz91yf"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1805/4637/files/IMG_6528.jpg?v=1754412783&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1805/4637/files/IMG_6528.jpg?v=1754412783&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1805/4637/files/IMG_6528.jpg?v=1754412783&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1805/4637/files/IMG_6528.jpg?v=1754412783" cla